{"title":"JVM与JFR事件-Java Application/Object Allocation Outside TLAB","uid":"b147315b89a85731b2287b431eb39da3","slug":"jfr/4. JVM与JFR事件-Object Allocation Outside TLAB","date":"2025-02-22T14:25:52.000Z","updated":"2025-03-31T09:42:46.913Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/jfr/4. JVM与JFR事件-Object Allocation Outside TLAB.json","keywords":null,"cover":[],"content":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1CBKLe9ECN?spm_id_from=333.788.videopod.sections&vd_source=3950f615078c921132561647ae6a1ddd\">本系列参考张哥JFR全系列</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"基础信息\"><a href=\"#基础信息\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"基础信息\"></a>基础信息</h3><ul>\n<li>Type(JVM,JDK内部唯一标识，用于jfr配置): <code>jdk.ObjectAllocationOutsideTLAB</code></li>\n<li>Label(Event Type，用于显示): Object Allocation Outside TLAB</li>\n<li>Category(用于分类显示): Java Application</li>\n<li>事件从哪个版本引入？<ul>\n<li>Java11：即一开始就存在</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>事件类型<ul>\n<li><code>埋点事件：即满足某些条件会触发的采集事件</code></li>\n<li><code>JVM内部事件</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>此事件对应 <a href=\"https://taeyang0126.github.io/2025/02/22/jvm/java-dui-xiang-fen-pei-guo-cheng/posts/undefined/?highlight=%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D\">Java对象分配过程</a> 中的<code>路径三</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"jfc配置\"><a href=\"#jfc配置\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"jfc配置\"></a>jfc配置</h3><ul>\n<li>default.jfc 配置<figure class=\"shiki xml\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre class=\"shiki material-theme-palenight\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">event</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">name</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">=</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #C3E88D\">jdk.ObjectAllocationOutsideTLAB</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">    </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">setting</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">name</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">=</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #C3E88D\">enabled</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">control</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">=</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #C3E88D\">gc-enabled-high</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">false</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">setting</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">    </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">setting</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">name</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">=</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #C3E88D\">stackTrace</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">true</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">setting</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\">event</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&gt;</span></span></code></pre></div></div></figure></li>\n<li>Profiling.jfc 配置<figure class=\"shiki xml\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></div><